00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.360
Step number one, generate your base image.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.400
This is the most important step for achieving hyperrealism.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.300
To get the best results, I use Quora Pro because it produces insane skin texture,

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.500
