00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:24.840
Every image that you're seeing here was generated with Quora Pro.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.960
Step number two, upscale your images.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:31.580
Inside enhancer, select Chris Upscaler, upload your Quora image and boom!

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:36.560
Now your image has a sharper and more detailed finish, maintaining all the skin imperfections.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:38.820
Step number three, bring your images to life.

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:43.400
You need your character to express emotion and move naturally, something that most lip-syncing

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:44.780
